{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一段的大号白字和珊瑚红强调词“不再藏着喜欢”首先入眼；随后中间黄色强调词“连害臊都顾不上了”“没什么不好”以及下方灰白色大字也很抢眼。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他决定不再隐藏自己对对方的喜欢。更具体的处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、坦然、不再羞于在乎对方；同时隐约有心疼感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他意识到自己需要对方，也愿意继续陪伴对方，即使对方不需要他；心疼的具体原因是未来对方是否还愿意让他陪伴、两人未必能一直亲近。中间小字中的期待得到满足、旧房子和梦境等情绪铺垫也不容易第一眼拿到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方红色段、中间黄色段、下方灰白段都比较显眼，存在多个主视线入口。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：“不再藏着喜欢”交代处境，“高兴得连害臊都顾不上了”交代感受，下方又补充欢喜为何变成心口发疼，需要拼接才能理解完整关系。\",\n    \"上方和下方的大字都是较长的复句，单块内部包含不止一层意思。\",\n    \"中间四行小字连续堆叠，需要在多条描述之间挑选，增加辅助信息的扫读负担。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2caec17-63f1-42bf-b7cd-c07287c82bd5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012356558139Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:24:41.043054+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d3f93fd3111ac6524a9baaa386b416ec4c40a9abbc96307ca5fd57b7f9c24143", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e